OL,3,GNEWSASchool leaders vote in favour of
OL,4,Aindustrial action, says union
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Welsh government said a 4.25% pay
OL,7,Frise was "unaffordable in the current
OL,8,Fclimate", but agreed to a 3.5%
OL,9,Fincrease, bringing pay in line with
OL,10,FEngland.
